 357:   // True only when the user has taken control of the viewport via a real
 358:   // gesture (wheel, touch, scrollbar drag). Buffer geometry is NOT a reliable
 359:   // signal: xterm updates viewportY asynchronously during rapid writes.
 360:   userScrolled: boolean
